{
  "//": [
    "Accessibility gate. Run against a built preview:",
    "  npm run build && npx vite preview --port 4173 & npm run a11y",
    "",
    "Only the two public routes are listed. The signed-in routes need a real",
    "session — a refresh token in localStorage plus an API to exchange it — so",
    "covering them here would mean either checking a credential into the repo or",
    "asserting against a login form that never resolves. Run those against a",
    "deployed environment instead, with --config a11y.authed.json.",
    "",
    "Colour contrast is the reason this exists: text over translucent glass is",
    "exactly the thing that regresses silently when a tint gets nudged."
  ],
  "defaults": {
    "standard": "WCAG2AA",
    "timeout": 30000,
    "wait": 700,
    "concurrency": 1,
    "reporters": ["cli"],
    "chromeLaunchConfig": {
      "args": ["--no-sandbox", "--disable-dev-shm-usage"]
    },
    "ignore": []
  },
  "urls": [
    "http://localhost:4173/login",
    "http://localhost:4173/signup"
  ]
}
